==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|la|mūs|t1=a mouse|-culus|pos2=diminutive suffix}}, or literally {{m-g|little mouse}}. The {{m-g|muscle}} sense is a {{semantic loan|la|grc|μῦς||mouse; muscle|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|mūsculus}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mūsculus<2>}}

# {{lb|la|literally}} a [[small]] [[mouse]]
# {{lb|la|transferred sense}}
## a [[companion]] of the [[whale]]
## a [[saltwater]] [[mussel]]
## {{lb|la|anatomy}} a [[muscle]]
## {{lb|la|military}} a [[shed]], [[mantelet]], [[shielding]]
## {{ngd|A kind of small [[sailing]] [[vessel]].}}

{{rfq|la}}

